WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:05.254
Imagine taking a complex testing workflow and moving parts of it

00:00:05.254 --> 00:00:09.959
into channels so small that fluid behaviour becomes a design constraint.

00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:18.848
Specimen collection, sample transport and preparation can

00:00:18.848 --> 00:00:22.897
determine whether a miniature diagnostic device is useful.

00:00:27.217 --> 00:00:32.053
Microfluidic systems can organise small volumes and reactions, but

00:00:32.053 --> 00:00:36.889
sensitivity and specificity still depend on the biological assay.

00:00:41.842 --> 00:00:46.176
Finding an analytical signal requires distinguishing target

00:00:46.176 --> 00:00:50.510
detection, contamination, false results and the clinical situation.

00:00:55.008 --> 00:00:59.670
Manufacturability, reliable reagents, operator burden and clinical

00:00:59.670 --> 00:01:04.331
validation decide whether a clever microsystem becomes useful.

00:01:09.092 --> 00:01:14.250
The 2021 review surveys microfluidic approaches to respiratory-virus

00:01:14.250 --> 00:01:19.409
detection and the evidence required beyond the chip itself.
